  (text "RSENSE + limb_a + limb_b (8 channels)" (at 185.42 177.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 47b56d76-655c-4946-875a-0129508df5e1))
  (text "RSENSE + limb_a + limb_b (8 channels)" (at 185.42 212.88 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 8bce1f64-130c-45d6-b9ab-a78d843432e9))
  (text "RSENSE + limb_a + limb_b (8 channels)" (at 185.42 248.44 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 61be6457-7c6e-458b-88b1-cc09f23bc9f6))
  (text "Nano R4 pin choices: D9 (RCLK) must be a GPT timer output; D11/D13 hardware SPI. D6 (formerly KA) is now unused. Verify against the Nano R4 pinout." (at 100 40 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid d7d45a8a-a317-48ea-aa40-bd72d0e60ed9))
  (text "IMU: 3.3 V and I2C come from the Nano through solder pads under its Qwiic holes (see imu sheet). D2 left free for an IMU interrupt if level-shifted later." (at 100 44 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid cd2bf7e5-2fc4-48ca-b36e-9870b6cc7d44))
  (text "No electrical link at this level: TP1202/TP1203 solder to the Nano Qwiic holes; SWD holes TP1204-1208." (at 45 74 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 13f50e34-5b03-4f2c-a30b-7dd2e4f71a76))
  (text "Group A = limbs L1+L2, B = L3+L4, C = L5+L6. Each limb holds two antagonist pairs (W1/W2, W3/W4)." (at 185 142 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 72289c79-3acf-4665-ba65-9973627d0f61))
